    "sql": "bounded-startup.sql"
  },
  "notes": [
    "All nine launches passed trace/error/cardinality/thermal gates, using the same APK and packaged Baseline Profile, 60 Hz endpoint policy, no full Compose tracing, R8 disabled.",
    "Runs are sequential, three per condition, at 32.8\u201333.6 C with background activity. They establish mechanisms, not regression thresholds or a robust speedup estimate.",
    "Cache-preserving avoids explicit cache clearing but does not guarantee every shader is resident. Effects-off iteration 0 compiled 27 pipelines; retained in all raw results.",
    "Soft-effects off improves median TTFD only 3.014 ms (1.4%); do not disable visuals from this pilot. Its startup also transitions from initial default effects-on preferences.",
    "COLD versus cache-preserving median TTFD differs by 270.949 ms; this is cache state sensitivity, not a source-code optimization.",
    "Cold main-thread explicit I/O wait median 52.067 ms and RenderThread pipeline compilation median 128.011 ms overlap with other phases and must not be added to nested wall timings.",
    "Concurrent process CPU totals are summed across cores; they do not prove those processes directly blocked the app. System_server/SurfaceFlinger work also includes normal launch/render work.",
    "App-ready was previously unobservable because an inventory State was read only inside SideEffect. Eagerly reading it during composition fixes subscription without dropping any readiness requirement."
  ],
